    {
      "text": "Forest plot (Figure A) of TB detection by the Abbott RealTime MTB assay for 12 studies, listing TP, FP, FN and TN counts with sensitivity and specificity (95% CI) and plots on a 0–1 scale. Sensitivity ranges from 0.79 (Berhanu 2018) to 1.00 and specificity from 0.84 (Wang 2016) to 1.00.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
